### Try the API locally (Development): the X-Dev-User header signs you in without Entra.
@api = http://localhost:5180/api/v1
@me = Sujay

### 1. Create the yatra (you become its accountant; the four sevas are seeded without rates)
POST {{api}}/yatras
X-Dev-User: {{me}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mantralaya Yatra 2026", "startsOn": "2026-12-01", "endsOn": "2026-12-08", "displayName": "Sujay" }

### 2. Your yatras — copy the id into @yatra below
GET {{api}}/yatras
X-Dev-User: {{me}}

###
@yatra = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 3. Set Sarva Seva's rate (₹1,001 = 100100 paise) — the real rates are yours to enter
PUT {{api}}/yatras/{{yatra}}/seva-types/SRV
X-Dev-User: {{me}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sarva Seva", "ratePaise": 100100, "dailyLimit": null, "requiresSankalpa": true, "isActive": true, "sortOrder": 2 }

### 4. Add a volunteer; they sign in with this email
POST {{api}}/yatras/{{yatra}}/members
X-Dev-User: {{me}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ramesh@dev.invalid", "displayName": "Ramesh", "role": "volunteer" }

### 5. Ramesh books a seva and takes UPI, as his phone would push it
POST {{api}}/yatras/{{yatra}}/sync/push
X-Dev-User: Ramesh
X-Dev-Email: ramesh@dev.invalid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "6f1c2a52-3a43-4f5e-9d1a-2b1f6f0c9a11",
  "bookings": [{
    "id": "0b8d1f7a-1c2e-4f3a-8b5d-6e7f8a9b0c1d",
    "sevaCode": "SRV",
    "sevaDate": "2026-12-04",
    "devoteeName": "Venkatesh Kulkarni",
    "sankalpa": { "onBehalfOf": "Venkatesh Kulkarni & family", "gotra": "Vasishta", "nakshatra": "Ashwini", "rashi": "Mesha" },
    "amountPaise": 100100,
    "draftReceiptNo": "SRV-D-RAM-0001",
    "recordedAt": "2026-12-01T09:15:00+05:30"
  }],
  "payments": [{
    "id": "2c4e6a8b-0d1f-4a3c-9e5b-7d9f1b3d5f7a",
    "bookingId": "0b8d1f7a-1c2e-4f3a-8b5d-6e7f8a9b0c1d",
    "amountPaise": 100100,
    "mode": "upi",
    "reference": "412345",
    "recordedAt": "2026-12-01T09:16:00+05:30"
  }]
}

### 6. The register for the seva day
GET {{api}}/yatras/{{yatra}}/register?date=2026-12-04
X-Dev-User: {{me}}

### 7. The priest's list
GET {{api}}/yatras/{{yatra}}/register/priest-list?date=2026-12-04
X-Dev-User: {{me}}

### 8. Everything since the start (a new phone's first pull)
GET {{api}}/yatras/{{yatra}}/sync/pull?after=0
X-Dev-User: {{me}}
